id: DRAFT-pbbam-2.4.0-meson-test-args-jsonl-count-optional-gate
trigger_tool: meson|conan|test
phase: building|testing
error_signature: meson-logs/testlog.txt not found|Program 'samtools' not found or not executable|Extra data: line 2 column 1|patch stream is incomplete|no member named 'contains' in 'std::set
severity: 3
category: build-system, testing, compat, ohos
match_keywords: meson_test_args, testlog_jsonl, find_program_required_false, cpp_std_cxx20, conan_patch_hunk_header
title: Conan2 Meson测试兼容与计数：直调meson test替代test(args)、testlog.json JSONL单源计数与外部工具可选门控
root_cause: Conan develop2源码Meson.test(self)无args形参，配方meson.test(args)抛TypeError被吞致meson test零执行无日志；meson1.11 testlog.json为每行一对象的JSONL整读必报Extra data；tools/meson.build对仅测试需的samtools用无required:false硬查找缺二进制即configure失败；ohos profile下发c++17覆盖上游cpp_std=c++20致contains编译错；手写补丁hunk头行号计数偏离git容忍offset但Conan严格校验拒绝
verification_cmd: 真机conan create跑meson test -v --print-errorlogs后检查meson-logs/testlog.json双模式解码计数恒等式与meson-log.txt外部工具记录，保留真实上游结果与HMBS_TEST_PACKAGE_RESULT
affected_scope: 上游用Meson构建且需meson test计数的其他Meson库，尤其依赖外部二进制做cram、用cpp_std=c++20特性、需打conandata补丁的库
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: direct-meson-test-jsonl-single-source-optional-gate
rec_description: build直调meson test替代Meson.test(args)，计数器以testlog.json逐条name/result为唯一单源做整文档加逐行双模式解码，外部二进制改required:false加found守卫按缺失excluded，工具链恢复上游cpp_std并用difflib重生成标准hunk头
rec_command: conanfile.py build改self.run(meson test -v --print-errorlogs); generate设tc.cpp_std=c++20并注入缺失宏; tools/meson.build补丁加required:false; marker改testlog.json单源双模式计数
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: keep-gap-audit-without-masking-failure
fallback_description: 单例压缩敏感断言或缺工具链不可对齐时不断言不跳过，如实记test_failure或environment缺口并透出gtest XML原文，计数破坏时拒发passed
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: meson\.test\(args=
forbid_1_reason: 禁止Conan2下向Meson.test传args，TypeError被吞致测试零执行而marker误报缺日志
forbid_1_consequence: 真机300/300构建成功后仍报meson-logs/testlog.txt not found且executed为0，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-pbbam-2.4.0-meson-test-args-jsonl-count-optional-gate.md
last_updated: 2026-10-14
source_event: pbbam/2.4.0 真机预检meson零执行与JSONL误判及samtools硬失败修复全链路
authors: hmbs-executor
